There's a lot of liquidity in Ethereum Classic. It's just trapped.

At Devcon, the Ethereum Economic Zone team was asked if a proof-of-work chain could join.

Their answer: it's possible.

ETC → Ethereum assets, lending and liquidity
ETH → ETC's untapped liquidity

No dedicated bridge. Not a zero-sum game.

